WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
Auntie, your sister is in the hospital now.

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,160
The doctor said she might have a gastric perforation

3
00:00:04,160 --> 00:00:13,620
Now I’m going to have a gastroscopy and have my eyesight done.

4
00:00:13,620 --> 00:00:16,020
Mom, since my sister won’t let me go

5
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:17,740
I won't bother her first

6
00:00:17,740 --> 00:00:19,900
Tell your sister to take it easy

7
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:22,130
Be careful with windows

8
00:00:22,130 --> 00:00:24,770
As expected, Lin Bianyue pulled the car full of

9
00:00:24,770 --> 00:00:26,890
The driver called an ambulance to take him away.

10
00:00:26,890 --> 00:00:29,280
That picture shouldn’t be too beautiful

11
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:31,240
This is too beautiful

12
00:00:31,240 --> 00:00:33,260
Baby will definitely like it

13
00:00:33,260 --> 00:00:35,620
Little sister, give me another copper-colored one

14
00:00:35,620 --> 00:00:44,350
I want the mother-daughter version

15
00:00:44,510 --> 00:00:52,010
Okay, okay, go by yourself

16
00:00:52,010 --> 00:00:53,730
Rainbow Dash is so cute

17
00:00:53,730 --> 00:00:55,570
That's something I'm not humble about

18
00:00:55,570 --> 00:00:56,970
Your Yuhuai family hasn’t returned to China yet

19
00:00:56,970 --> 00:00:58,810
That Mu Ge only knows how to work

20
00:00:58,810 --> 00:01:00,650
I think he will regret it sooner or later

21
00:01:00,650 --> 00:01:02,370
A girl with one egg

22
00:01:02,370 --> 00:01:04,050
The daughter-in-law went abroad to look for her

23
00:01:04,050 --> 00:01:05,410
She's like a piece of wood

24
00:01:05,410 --> 00:01:07,130
I don’t know how to find time to accompany you.

25
00:01:07,130 --> 00:01:10,330
Now my wife over there has returned directly to Hong Kong City.

26
00:01:10,330 --> 00:01:11,650
Should I have known this

27
00:01:11,650 --> 00:01:15,810
It's better to be a bachelor directly

28
00:01:15,810 --> 00:01:17,650
Jingjing is less than five years old

29
00:01:17,650 --> 00:01:19,610
My parents have been separated all year round

30
00:01:19,610 --> 00:01:21,890
I'm worried about her mental health

31
00:01:22,010 --> 00:01:23,370
That won't happen, Lao Mu

32
00:01:23,370 --> 00:01:28,790
Look how good she is playing with Rainbow Dash, right?

33
00:01:28,790 --> 00:01:30,790
Rainbow Dash is lively and cute

34
00:01:30,790 --> 00:01:31,950
likeable
